{
  "file": "common childhood",
  "page": 69,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        115.84590148925781,
        27.289522171020508,
        337.6759338378906,
        35.34652328491211
      ],
      "text": "8. EVIDENCE FOR RECOMMENDATIONS ON TREATMENT OF FEVER CONDITIONS",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Ligh",
      "size": 7.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        59.74208068847656,
        399.0830078125,
        73.2320785522461
      ],
      "text": "reduced culture positivity after 10 to 48 hours, currently low levels of resistance, and",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        72.74208068847656,
        399.08294677734375,
        86.2320785522461
      ],
      "text": "only once daily required dosing. Single daily dosing of ceftriaxone is a significant",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        85.74208068847656,
        399.08294677734375,
        99.2320785522461
      ],
      "text": "advantage over the 6-hourly injections of the standard chloramphenicol/beta-lactam",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        98.74208068847656,
        396.8504943847656,
        112.2320785522461
      ],
      "text": "combination. Use of cephalosporins as initial therapy would be of benefit in situa­",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        111.74208068847656,
        396.8504943847656,
        125.2320785522461
      ],
      "text": "tions where antimicrobial resistance is not known in the context of increasing resist­",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        124.74208068847656,
        172.9429168701172,
        138.23208618164062
      ],
      "text": "ance to avoid high mortality.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        137.61207580566406,
        396.85040283203125,
        151.23208618164062
      ],
      "text": "H. influ­ There is substantial evidence to suggest that an increasing proportion of",
      "font": "MinionPro-It",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        150.61207580566406,
        399.10845947265625,
        164.23208618164062
      ],
      "text": "enzae S. pneumoniae  and   isolated from meningitis cases are resistant to ampicillin",
      "font": "MinionPro-It",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        163.7421112060547,
        396.8504943847656,
        177.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "and chloramphenicol. Since these are the common causes of acute bacterial meningi­",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        176.7421112060547,
        359.8529052734375,
        190.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "tis, their use as an empirical treatment may lead to poor clinical outcomes.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        198.23611450195312,
        81.16291046142578,
        210.37611389160156
      ],
      "text": "Risks",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Obli",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        211.24610900878906,
        296.552978515625,
        224.73611450195312
      ],
      "text": "Cephalosporins were associated with short-term diarrhoea.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        235.7646942138672,
        205.31298828125,
        247.75469970703125
      ],
      "text": "8.1.3\t Acceptability and feasibility",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Bold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        251.41929626464844,
        399.0528259277344,
        264.9093017578125
      ],
      "text": "Single daily dosing of ceftriaxone has significant advantage over the multiple, daily",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        264.4192810058594,
        399.12286376953125,
        277.9093017578125
      ],
      "text": "injections that require more staff time and inconvenience children and care­givers.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        277.4192810058594,
        396.8504943847656,
        290.9093017578125
      ],
      "text": "Single daily dosing recommendation is much simpler than the current recommenda­",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        290.4192810058594,
        263.27294921875,
        303.9093017578125
      ],
      "text": "tion and may be preferred by clinicians and nurses.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        303.4192810058594,
        399.051513671875,
        316.9093017578125
      ],
      "text": "The reduced frequency of administration of ceftriaxone, along with the reduced",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        316.4192810058594,
        399.1229248046875,
        329.9093017578125
      ],
      "text": "time burden on staff, offsets its cost. The cost of cephalosporins will decrease with the",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        329.4192810058594,
        335.0328063964844,
        342.9093017578125
      ],
      "text": "increasing availability of generics. Median prices [MSH/WHO 2010]:",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        63.54180145263672,
        348.0885925292969,
        221.42185974121094,
        361.57861328125
      ],
      "text": "Chloramphenicol 1 g: US$ 0.4372/vial",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        350.3150634765625,
        63.541900634765625,
        359.3150634765625
      ],
      "text": "n",
      "font": "ZapfDingbats",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        63.54180145263672,
        361.0885925292969,
        211.57180786132812,
        374.57861328125
      ],
      "text": "Ampicillin 250 mg: US$ 0.1786/vial",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        363.3150634765625,
        63.541900634765625,
        372.3150634765625
      ],
      "text": "n",
      "font": "ZapfDingbats",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        63.54180145263672,
        374.0885925292969,
        238.08184814453125,
        387.57861328125
      ],
      "text": "Benzyl penicillin 600 mg: US$ 0.0864/vial",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        376.3150634765625,
        63.541900634765625,
        385.3150634765625
      ],
      "text": "n",
      "font": "ZapfDingbats",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        63.54180145263672,
        387.0885925292969,
        215.91183471679688,
        400.57861328125
      ],
      "text": "Ceftriaxone 250 mg: US$ 0.4395/vial",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        389.3150634765625,
        63.541900634765625,
        398.3150634765625
      ],
      "text": "n",
      "font": "ZapfDingbats",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        410.6361999511719,
        315.324951171875,
        423.8251953125
      ],
      "text": "8.2\t Antibiotic treatment for Acute Otitis Media (AOM)",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Bold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        427.26177978515625,
        399.1328430175781,
        440.7518005371094
      ],
      "text": "a)\t Children with acute otitis media (AOM) should be treated with oral amoxicillin",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        440.26177978515625,
        222.25157165527344,
        453.7518005371094
      ],
      "text": "40 mg/kg twice per day for 7–10 days.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        453.26177978515625,
        70.2428970336914,
        466.7518005371094
      ],
      "text": "OR",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        466.26177978515625,
        396.7728576660156,
        479.7518005371094
      ],
      "text": "b)\tWhere pathogens causing acute otitis media are known to be sensitive to co-",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        479.26177978515625,
        399.13128662109375,
        492.7518005371094
      ],
      "text": "trimoxazole, this antibiotic could be used as an alternative given twice per day for",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        492.26177978515625,
        109.18151092529297,
        505.7518005371094
      ],
      "text": "7–10 days.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        507.66650390625,
        252.91282653808594,
        521.5864868164062
      ],
      "text": "(Strong recommendation, low quality evidence)",
      "font": "MinionPro-BoldIt",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        523.9310913085938,
        399.0428771972656,
        537.4210815429688
      ],
      "text": "The panel noted that there was a lack of RCTs addressing the treatment of AOM from",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        536.9310913085938,
        399.1128234863281,
        550.4210815429688
      ],
      "text": "developing countries as most studies had been conducted in developed countries.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        549.9310913085938,
        399.0830383300781,
        563.4210815429688
      ],
      "text": "In addition, it was noted that poor performance of diagnostic criteria makes",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        562.9310913085938,
        399.1427001953125,
        576.4210815429688
      ],
      "text": "interpretation of AOM studies difficult as has been reported in a recent systematic",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        575.9310913085938,
        141.53289794921875,
        589.4210815429688
      ],
      "text": "review [Coker, 2010].",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        588.9310913085938,
        399.0215759277344,
        602.4210815429688
      ],
      "text": "The choice of amoxicillin was not entirely based on the evidence from the data",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        601.9310913085938,
        399.0628967285156,
        615.4210815429688
      ],
      "text": "reviewed in the RCTs, but also on the consideration of aetiological causes of AOM",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        614.9310913085938,
        398.9828796386719,
        628.4210815429688
      ],
      "text": "and data on antibiotic resistance. It was also found much more feasible and easy to",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        223.37950134277344,
        644.9403076171875,
        231.6595001220703,
        655.2992553710938
      ],
      "text": "55",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Ligh",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    }
  ]
}